            "review_title": "Review at Ớt Hiểm Thai Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Carla M\n275 contributions\n0\nIncredible dining experience 🤍\nFeb 2025 • Couples\nHad an amazing dining experience at Othiem Thai Cuisine in Nha Trang! \n\nTheir Thai food is absolutely delicious, with so many incredible options to choose from. Whether you’re craving something comforting or adventurous, they have it all!\n\nI couldn’t get enough of their Pad Thai—it was perfectly cooked, packed with flavor, and just the right balance of sweet, savory, and tangy. Definitely one of the best I’ve had!\n\nTo complement the meal, I had a fresh coconut water, which was so refreshing and the perfect way to cool down.\n\nI also tried their steak, and it was cooked to perfection—tender, juicy, and full of flavor.\n\nOne of the highlights of the meal was their special dish, Miang Kham Lotus. It was not only incredibly tasty but also beautifully presented, making the dining experience even more special.\n\nIf you’re in Nha Trang and love Thai food, this is definitely a place you don’t want to miss! 🇹🇭✨\nRead more\nWritten February 5, 2025",
